  "lines": {
    "hook": "Goalkeepers are supposed to arrive late. Here are the ten best aged twenty-one or under, by their EA FC 27 ratings.",
    "items": [
      "Our first deep cut: Nazar Domchak, Slavia Prague. Sixty-seven.",
      "And our second: Edoardo Motta, Lazio. Sixty-nine, up ten points in a year.",
      "Ewen Jaouen, Newcastle. Seventy.",
      "Tommaso Martinelli, Avellino. Seventy.",
