      "Santiago Beltrán, River Plate. Seventy-three, another ten-point jump.",
      "Matthieu Epolo, Standard Liège. Seventy-five.",
      "Mike Penders, Chelsea. Seventy-eight.",
      "Guillaume Restes, Toulouse. Seventy-eight.",
      "And the best young goalkeeper in the game: Robin Risser, Lens. Eighty-one, up ten."
